  "body": "<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at v0.5.3 -->\n\n## What's Changed\n### Bug Fixes\n* Escape SQLite identifiers by @draarivpatel-ui in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/114\n* fix(db): rename duplicate column names instead of failing CREATE TABLE by @kiki-ki in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/116\n### Dependencies\n* build(tools): manage tools in a separate module updated by Dependabot by @kiki-ki in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/106\n* chore(deps): bump golang.org/x/vuln from 1.1.4 to 1.9.0 in /tools in the tools group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/107\n* chore(deps): bump modernc.org/sqlite from 1.61.0 to 1.61.1 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/108\n* chore(deps): bump the minor-patch group with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/109\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/goreleaser/goreleaser/v2 from 2.19.0 to 2.20.1 in /tools in the tools group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/110\n* chore(deps): bump github.com/tidwall/gjson from 1.20.2 to 1.20.4 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/112\n* chore(deps): bump actions/setup-go from 7.0.0 to 7.1.0 in the minor-patch group by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/111\n* chore(deps): bump the minor-patch group with 2 updates by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/115\n* chore(deps): migrate bubbletea, bubbles and lipgloss to v2 by @kiki-ki in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/125\n### Other Changes\n* ci: replace Dependabot with Renovate by @kiki-ki in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/117\n* ci: let Renovate bump the go directive by @kiki-ki in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/122\n* chore(deps): update all non-major dependencies by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/119\n* ci: group dependency updates in release notes by @kiki-ki in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/126\n\n## New Contributors\n* @draarivpatel-ui made their first contribution in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/114\n* @renovate[bot] made their first contribution in https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/pull/119\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/kiki-ki/go-qo/compare/v0.5.2...v0.5.3\n\n",
